        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt Thiessen, George Thorogood, Jon Foreman\n- Bands: Relient K, Switchfoot, Ruth\n- Songs: \"Rebuild\"\n- Events: 2007 Appetite for Construction Tour\n\nFacts:\n- George Thorogood was born on February 24, 1950, and he is an American musician, singer, and songwriter from Wilmington, Delaware.\n- Matt Thiessen was born on August 12, 1980, and he is a Canadian-American musician, singer, and songwriter.\n- Matt Thiessen is the co-founder, lead singer, guitarist, pianist, and primary songwriter of the Christian rock band Relient K.\n- Jon Foreman of Switchfoot and Matt Thiessen of Relient K wrote the song \"Rebuild.\"\n- The song \"Rebuild\" was written in conjunction with the 2007 Appetite for Construction Tour.\n- The 2007 Appetite for Construction Tour featured members from Switchfoot, Relient K, and Ruth.",
